# Input

```svelte
<div>
<!-- prettier-ignore-start -->

<div      > no format madness here </div>

<p>
    no
    toplevel
</p>

<!-- prettier-ignore-end -->
</div>

<div>We all need to adhere sadly</div>

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,9 +1,12 @@
 <div>
     <!-- prettier-ignore-start -->
 
-    <div>no format madness here</div>
+    <div      > no format madness here </div>
 
-    <p>no toplevel</p>
+    <p>
+    no
+    toplevel
+</p>
 
     <!-- prettier-ignore-end -->
 </div>
```

# Output

```svelte
<div>
    <!-- prettier-ignore-start -->

    <div      > no format madness here </div>

    <p>
    no
    toplevel
</p>

    <!-- prettier-ignore-end -->
</div>

<div>We all need to adhere sadly</div>
```
